---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bend Oregon SEO & Local Search Consultant | Mitchell Haw"
  description="SEO, Google Maps, local search, AI search, website strategy, and content help for businesses in Bend and Central Oregon."
  image="/images/bend-river.png"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@graph": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "@id": "https://mitchellhaw.com/#person",
          "name": "Mitchell Haw",
          "url": "https://mitchellhaw.com/",
          "jobTitle": "SEO & AI Search Consultant",
          "image": "https://mitchellhaw.com/images/mitchell-haw.jpg",
          "sameAs": ["https://www.linkedin.com/in/mitchellhaw"],
          "address": {
            "@type": "PostalAddress",
            "addressLocality": "Bend",
            "addressRegion": "OR",
            "addressCountry": "US"
          },
          "description": "Bend-based digital strategist helping businesses improve SEO, local visibility, AI search visibility, content, and organic growth."
        },
        {
          "@type": "WebSite",
          "@id": "https://mitchellhaw.com/#website",
          "url": "https://mitchellhaw.com/",
          "name": "Mitchell Haw",
          "publisher": {"@id": "https://mitchellhaw.com/#person"}
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <main class="co-home">
    <section class="co-hero">
      <div class="container co-hero-grid">
        <div class="co-hero-copy">
          <p class="co-kicker">SEO + LOCAL SEARCH · BEND & CENTRAL OREGON</p>
          <h1>Help more local customers find—and choose—your business.</h1>
          <p class="co-hero-text">
            I help Central Oregon businesses show up better in Google, Maps, and AI search, improve the pages customers land on, and turn more of that visibility into calls, bookings, visits, estimates, and leads.
          </p>

          <div class="co-actions">
            <a class="co-btn co-btn-primary" href="/contact/">Tell Me About Your Business</a>
            <a class="co-btn co-btn-secondary" href="#services">See How I Can Help</a>
          </div>

          <div class="co-trust-row" aria-label="Service area and experience">
            <span>Based in Bend</span>
            <span>Serving Central Oregon</span>
            <span>Local + national experience</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="co-hero-media" aria-label="Bend and Central Oregon scenes">
          <figure class="co-media-main">
            <img src="/images/bend-river.png" alt="Deschutes River in Bend, Oregon" />
            <figcaption>Bend, Oregon</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="co-media-small">
            <img src="/images/black-butte-hike.png" alt="Central Oregon landscape near Black Butte" loading="lazy" />
          </figure>
          <figure class="co-media-small">
            <img src="/images/deschutes-brewery-bend-downtown.png" alt="Downtown Bend, Oregon" loading="lazy" />
          </figure>

          <div class="co-hero-offer">
            <span>WHAT I HELP WITH</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Google & Maps visibility</li>
              <li>Website SEO & service pages</li>
              <li>AI search visibility</li>
              <li>Content & measurement</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-owner-problems">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="co-heading co-heading-split">
          <div>
            <p class="co-kicker">DOES THIS SOUND FAMILIAR?</p>
            <h2>Search should help grow the business—not create another thing to manage.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Most local owners do not need “more SEO.” They need clearer answers about why they are not getting found, what is worth fixing, and how to turn online visibility into real business.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="co-problem-grid">
          <article class="co-problem-card">
            <div class="co-problem-mark">01</div>
            <h3>“We should be showing up more in Bend.”</h3>
            <p>You are good at what you do, but competitors are ahead of you in Google, Maps, or local searches that should be sending customers your way.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="co-problem-card">
            <div class="co-problem-mark">02</div>
            <h3>“Our website exists, but it is not bringing in enough business.”</h3>
            <p>The site may need clearer service pages, stronger local relevance, better structure, or a simpler path from search result to phone call or inquiry.</p>
          </article>

          <article class="co-problem-card">
            <div class="co-problem-mark">03</div>
            <h3>“I do not know what marketing work actually matters.”</h3>
            <p>You have rankings, analytics, reviews, AI search, content, ads, and a hundred recommendations competing for attention. I help narrow it down.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-services" id="services">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="co-heading co-heading-split">
          <div>
            <p class="co-kicker">WHAT I DO</p>
            <h2>Clear search help, built around the problem you are trying to solve.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            You do not need to know whether the answer is “technical SEO,” “GEO,” or “local citations” before reaching out. Tell me what is not working. I will help figure out what matters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="co-service-grid">
          <a class="co-service-card co-service-featured" href="/services/seo-bend-oregon/">
            <div class="co-service-topline">
              <span>LOCAL SEO + GOOGLE MAPS</span>
              <b>Most common local need</b>
            </div>
            <h3>Get found by more people nearby.</h3>
            <p class="co-service-intro">For businesses that want more local calls, bookings, visits, estimates, or inquiries.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Google Business Profile & Maps visibility</li>
              <li>Local service and location pages</li>
              <li>Reviews, listings, and local signals</li>
              <li>Local competitor and search opportunity review</li>
            </ul>
            <strong>Explore Local SEO →</strong>
          </a>

          <a class="co-service-card" href="/services/seo/">
            <div class="co-service-topline"><span>WEBSITE SEO + ORGANIC GROWTH</span></div>
            <h3>Make your website easier to find—and easier to use.</h3>
            <p class="co-service-intro">For sites that are not ranking, converting, or clearly explaining what the business offers.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Technical SEO & website structure</li>
              <li>Service-page and content planning</li>
              <li>Internal linking & search intent</li>
              <li>Migrations, cleanup, and priority fixes</li>
            </ul>
            <strong>Explore SEO Strategy →</strong>
          </a>

          <a class="co-service-card" href="/services/ai-search/">
            <div class="co-service-topline"><span>AI SEARCH VISIBILITY</span></div>
            <h3>Know whether AI tools find and recommend your business.</h3>
            <p class="co-service-intro">For businesses wondering how they show up in ChatGPT, Google AI, Gemini, Perplexity, and newer discovery tools.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Brand and competitor visibility benchmarks</li>
              <li>Prompt, source, and citation analysis</li>
              <li>Website and brand-information gaps</li>
              <li>Practical improvements tied back to SEO</li>
            </ul>
            <strong>Explore AI Search →</strong>
          </a>

          <a class="co-service-card" href="/services/video-marketing/">
            <div class="co-service-topline"><span>CONTENT + WEBSITE STRATEGY</span></div>
            <h3>Give customers better reasons to find, trust, and contact you.</h3>
            <p class="co-service-intro">For businesses that need clearer pages, stronger content, or a better way to answer the questions customers already have.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Service and FAQ content</li>
              <li>Local guides and useful resources</li>
              <li>Search-intent and content-gap planning</li>
              <li>Video and YouTube discovery strategy</li>
            </ul>
            <strong>Explore Content & Video →</strong>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="co-service-note">
          <div>
            <strong>Not sure which service you need?</strong>
            <span>That is normal. Start with the business problem and I can help identify the right work.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="/contact/">Tell me what you want to improve →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-engagements">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="co-heading co-heading-split">
          <div>
            <p class="co-kicker">WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER</p>
            <h2>Start as small—or as involved—as the problem requires.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Some businesses need a clear outside opinion. Others need a focused project or ongoing help making decisions. The scope can match the need.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="co-engagement-grid">
          <article class="co-engagement-card">
            <span class="co-engagement-label">START HERE</span>
            <h3>Visibility Review</h3>
            <p>A focused review of where your business is being found, where it is being missed, and what I would prioritize first.</p>
            <div class="co-engagement-for"><strong>Good for:</strong> “I know we could be doing better, but I do not know where to start.”</div>
          </article>

          <article class="co-engagement-card">
            <span class="co-engagement-label">FOCUSED WORK</span>
            <h3>SEO or Local Search Project</h3>
            <p>Hands-on strategy around a specific opportunity: local SEO, website structure, service pages, technical cleanup, content, or a migration.</p>
            <div class="co-engagement-for"><strong>Good for:</strong> “We know the problem and need help getting the right work done.”</div>
          </article>

          <article class="co-engagement-card">
            <span class="co-engagement-label">ONGOING SUPPORT</span>
            <h3>Search Strategy & Guidance</h3>
            <p>Ongoing prioritization, measurement, content direction, SEO guidance, and support as the website and search landscape change.</p>
            <div class="co-engagement-for"><strong>Good for:</strong> “We want someone experienced helping us decide what to do next.”</div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-local-story">
      <div class="container co-local-grid">
        <div class="co-local-images">
          <img class="co-local-large" src="/images/metolius-river.png" alt="Metolius River in Central Oregon" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/smith-rock-central-oregon.jpg" alt="Smith Rock in Central Oregon" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="/images/river-bend.png" alt="River scene in Bend, Oregon" loading="lazy" />
        </div>

        <div class="co-local-copy">
          <p class="co-kicker">CENTRAL OREGON</p>
          <h2>Local search works better when the strategy understands the market.</h2>
          <p class="co-local-lead">
            I live in Bend. A contractor, clinic, restaurant, outfitter, real estate business, professional service, and visitor-focused company all compete differently here.
          </p>
          <p>
            The goal is not to stuff “Bend, Oregon” onto a page. It is to understand how your customers search, what they compare, where they look for proof, and what makes them pick one local business over another.
          </p>

          <div class="co-location-links">
            <a href="/services/seo-bend-oregon/"><span>Bend</span><b>SEO + local visibility</b></a>
            <a href="/services/seo-redmond-oregon/"><span>Redmond</span><b>SEO + local visibility</b></a>
            <a href="/services/seo-sisters-oregon/"><span>Sisters</span><b>SEO + local visibility</b></a>
            <a href="/services/seo-sunriver-oregon/"><span>Sunriver</span><b>SEO + local visibility</b></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-about">
      <div class="container co-about-grid">
        <div class="co-about-media">
          <img src="/images/mitchell-haw.jpg" alt="Mitchell Haw, SEO consultant in Bend, Oregon" loading="lazy" />
          <div class="co-about-badge">
            <strong>Bend-based</strong>
            <span>SEO · Local Search · AI Search · Analytics</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="co-about-copy">
          <p class="co-kicker">ABOUT MITCHELL</p>
          <h2>You should not have to become an SEO expert to know what to do next.</h2>
          <p class="co-about-lead">
            I’m Mitchell Haw, a Bend-based digital strategist with experience across large national websites, multi-location search programs, technical migrations, local businesses, and my own web projects.
          </p>
          <p>
            My job is to make search simpler: find the biggest opportunities, explain what matters in plain English, and turn it into work that is useful to the business—not a 70-page audit that sits in a folder.
          </p>

          <div class="co-proof-row">
            <div><strong>Local perspective</strong><span>Based in Bend, Oregon</span></div>
            <div><strong>Broad experience</strong><span>Local businesses + national brands</span></div>
            <div><strong>Clear measurement</strong><span>GA4, Search Console + visibility</span></div>
          </div>

          <a class="co-text-link" href="/about/">More about me →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-process">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="co-heading co-heading-split">
          <div>
            <p class="co-kicker">HOW IT WORKS</p>
            <h2>Start with what you want more of.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>No bloated process. We start with the business goal, find what is getting in the way, and focus on the highest-value opportunities first.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="co-process-grid">
          <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h3>Tell me what you want to improve</h3>
            <p>More calls, bookings, local visibility, better leads, stronger rankings, a better website, or simply a clearer plan.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h3>Find where opportunity is being lost</h3>
            <p>Review the website, Google presence, competitors, content, technical setup, local signals, analytics, and AI search where relevant.</p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h3>Fix the most valuable work first</h3>
            <p>Prioritize what is most likely to matter, explain it clearly, and turn it into a practical plan your business can actually use.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="co-final">
      <div class="container co-final-card">
        <div>
          <p class="co-kicker">BEND + CENTRAL OREGON</p>
          <h2>Want more of the right people finding your business?</h2>
          <p>Tell me what you do, where you serve customers, and what you want to improve. You do not need to know which SEO service to ask for.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="co-btn co-btn-primary" href="/contact/">Tell Me About Your Business</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .co-home {
    --co-cream: #f5f2e9;
    --co-paper: #fffdf8;
    --co-ink: #1d2b24;
    --co-copy: #59665f;
    --co-forest: #356b57;
    --co-forest-dark: #285444;
    --co-river: #2f6f8f;
    --co-sage: #e5eee7;
    --co-sky: #e8f1f4;
    --co-line: #d7ddd7;
    --co-clay: #b86f52;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--co-cream);
    color: var(--co-ink);
  }

  .co-home .container {
    width: min(1180px, 92%);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .co-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--co-forest);
    font-size: .71rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .co-home h1,
  .co-home h2,
  .co-home h3 {
    color: var(--co-ink);
  }

  .co-hero {
    padding: 72px 0 92px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 7% 14%, rgba(53,107,87,.07), transparent 27%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f6ef 0%, var(--co-cream) 100%);
  }

  .co-hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .92fr) minmax(440px, 1.08fr);
    gap: 70px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .co-hero-copy h1 {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    font-size: clamp(3.55rem, 6.45vw, 5.95rem);
    line-height: .96;
    letter-spacing: -.058em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .co-hero-text {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    color: var(--co-copy);
    font-size: 1.13rem;
    line-height: 1.66;
  }

  .co-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .co-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 49px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 12px 19px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: .9rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: .18s ease;
  }

  .co-btn-primary {
    background: var(--co-forest);
    border: 1px solid var(--co-forest);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 9px 24px rgba(53,107,87,.16);
  }

  .co-btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--co-forest-dark);
    border-color: var(--co-forest-dark);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .co-btn-secondary {
    background: var(--co-paper);
    border: 1px solid #ccd4ce;
    color: var(--co-ink);
  }

  .co-btn-secondary:hover {
    border-color: #aab8af;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .co-trust-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 27px;
    color: #747f78;
    font-size: .74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .co-trust-row span:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '•';
    margin-left: 20px;
    color: #aeb7b1;
  }

  .co-hero-media {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.35fr .75fr;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    min-height: 560px;
    padding-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .co-hero-media figure {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: #d8dfdb;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(30,51,41,.09);
  }

  .co-hero-media img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .co-media-main {
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
  }

  .co-media-main figcaption {
    position: absolute;
    left: 16px;
    top: 16px;
    padding: 8px 11px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
    color: var(--co-forest);
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }

  .co-hero-offer {
    position: absolute;
    right: 18px;
    bottom: 0;
    width: min(330px, 72%);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(53,107,87,.16);
    border-radius: 15px;
    background: rgba(255,253,248,.95);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(30,51,41,.1);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
  }

  .co-hero-offer > span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 9px;
    color: var(--co-forest);
    font-size: .65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .co-hero-offer ul {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6px 12px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .co-hero-offer li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 13px;
    color: var(--co-ink);
    font-size: .76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .co-hero-offer li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: .63em;
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--co-river);
  }

  .co-owner-problems,
  .co-services,
  .co-engagements,
  .co-local-story,
  .co-about,
  .co-process,
  .co-final {
    padding: 94px 0;
  }

  .co-owner-problems {
    background: var(--co-paper);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--co-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--co-line);
  }

  .co-heading-split {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(320px, .72fr);
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: end;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
  }

  .co-heading h2,
  .co-local-copy h2,
  .co-about-copy h2,
  .co-final-card h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 4.65vw, 4.35rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -.048em;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .co-heading-split > p {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 0 0 4px;
    color: var(--co-copy);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .co-problem-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .co-problem-card {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 270px;
    padding: 28px 28px 30px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--co-line);
    border-radius: 17px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(30,51,41,.035);
  }

  .co-problem-card::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--co-forest), var(--co-river));
  }

  .co-problem-mark {
    display: inline-grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 35px;
    height: 35px;
    margin-bottom: 42px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--co-sage);
    color: var(--co-forest);
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .co-problem-card h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
  }

  .co-problem-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--co-copy);
    font-size: .92rem;
  }

  .co-services {
    background: var(--co-cream);
  }

  .co-service-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .co-service-card {
    display: flex;
    min-height: 430px;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid var(--co-line);
    border-radius: 19px;
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--co-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(30,51,41,.035);
    transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, border-color .18s ease;
  }

  .co-service-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: #b9c8be;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(30,51,41,.075);
  }

  .co-service-featured {
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #eef5f0 0%, var(--co-sage) 100%);
    border-color: #c8d9cd;
  }

  .co-service-topline {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 38px;
  }

  .co-service-topline span {
    color: var(--co-forest);
    font-size: .68rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .09em;
  }

  .co-service-topline b {
    padding: 6px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.72);
    color: var(--co-forest);
    font-size: .64rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .co-service-card h3 {
    max-width: 540px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 2.8vw, 2.25rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }

  .co-service-intro {
    margin: 0 0 20px !important;
    color: var(--co-copy);
